  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E09 2025版北美攀登事故报告中文版发布分享会</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/695504e614db1df9efc6f043</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">695504e614db1df9efc6f043</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 01 Jan 2026 10:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu8pXQJ5ENBNp3NV8gYLRu3Ntzt2.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>首先祝大家2026新年快乐！新年新气象，《2025版北美攀登事故报告中文版》正式发布了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在播客shownotes尾部中，你可以找到该报告PDF版本的下载链接，欢迎免费下载。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们翻译组的三位成员，我、Ian，还有雨湖，在“隐者山之道”品牌的支持下举办了中文版发布分享会。本期播客的主要内容来自这次发布分享会：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="226">00:03:46</a>: 发布会现场连线，三位翻译组成员靳毅、Ian、雨湖登场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="522">00:08:42</a>: 靳毅开场：一切“天灾”皆“人祸”，深入人类行为如何导致事故</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="671">00:11:11</a>: 风险点1：风险常态化——当熟悉成为弱点，警惕虚假安全感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="842">00:14:02</a>: 风险点2：从室内到野外——难度系数相同，风险天差地别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1179">00:19:39</a>: 风险点3：系统切换时——建站、拆站、换保护角色时最易出错</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1380">00:23:00</a>: 风险点4：备份失效——保护点、绳尾结，一个备份可能救你一命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1694">00:28:14</a>: 风险点5：攀登伙伴的社会契约——犹豫开口可能致命</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2267">00:37:47</a>: 风险点6：疲劳与压力——尤其在漫长一天的下撤阶段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2667">00:44:27</a>: 风险点7：低估客观风险——落石、雪崩、老旧保护点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2734">00:45:34</a>: 对机械塞的迷之自信——13起失效事故的警示与放置艺术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2958">00:49:18</a>: Ian登场：谈山登山滑雪中的风险管理</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3338">00:55:38</a>: 事故经过：两个经验丰富者如何被一个“SOLO客”影响判断</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3602">01:00:02</a>: 致命转折：目睹他人安全通过后，他们放松了警惕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4007">01:06:47</a>: Ian分享亲身经历：首次触发雪崩的惊魂时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4276">01:11:16</a>: 风险管理框架：从可能性、后果、脆弱性、暴露度四维度权衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4511">01:15:11</a>: 牢记：户外没有“绿灯”，只有持续的风险决策</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4630">01:17:10</a>: 总结：个人经验、共同决策、心理因素，缺一不可</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4716">01:18:36</a>: 雨湖登场：聚焦“下降”与“绳尾结”这个永恒杀手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4887">01:21:27</a>: 触目惊心的数据：2025年报告中，近1/5死亡事故与绳尾结相关</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5129">01:25:29</a>: 互检！ 绳尾结必须是搭档间相互检查的内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5365">01:29:25</a>: 效率与安全的平衡：叠式绳降法介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5573">01:32:53</a>: 核心呼吁：建立风险意识的攀登文化，告别“艺高人胆大”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5811">01:36:51</a>: 现场Q&amp;A开始：第一个问题关于事故报告的受众与传播</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6133">01:42:13</a>: Q2：国内攀登事故收集遇到哪些困难？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6475">01:47:55</a>: Q3：叠式绳降法中绳结防滑原理与安全性探讨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6745">01:52:25</a>: Q4：事故报告会吓退新人吗？如何理解攀登的风险？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7100">01:58:20</a>: Q5：国内外事故后环境差异（追责vs理性），从业者如何努力？</span></p><span></span><p><span>衷心感谢赞助品牌Vibram、隐者山之道、凯乐石、GARMONT对2025年《北美攀登事故报告》中文版译制工作的坚定支持！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmqrWcMfZNFuzCO2bC2YYxhAIeRx.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlI2xJsvfh5pC6ALmlk2cuZORQm-.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flu5Npn6SZ_axhXqkm1uEEFqgc0Y.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmBtKRJRTPxJaCEQQbKnbuF5EBBk.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fkda5cbY68VNOcB6yXaQ4IQCWsN9.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnb6_LDhKdKuHXVdIB4piPBWHdC8.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjPqVP_tQ_6JiXbNtFt2ptBXdskb.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrP3GGgJLkWsdRx4YXE7LKPGBUIV.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmuzYep5itMdPfCDwXaGXAAam-9M.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhKSW_WZd5qjD9d7kW00h82Pf6Y6.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlfMHmVkX_gsLnCkn9bJtpOkHlPX.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgtoiY-DQNpYCPF4aiOp2m7afJyx.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FknNGNWde8N_D92U1OKGXOzn5Inj.JPG"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>PDF版《报告》在线阅读和下载：</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>下载方法：截图或微信扫描二维码，进入小程序，点开对应报告“阅读报告”后，选择右上角“存储”即可下载</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgqiThwso8xgg6iKTjJQWgApRQdm.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
