  <item>
    <title>E08 离死亡最近的一次攀登丨复盘装备、技术与策略</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69088e1943a4f4a984b54361</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69088e1943a4f4a984b54361</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 03 Nov 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我俩在阿尔卑斯的冰川与冰山脊上</span></p><span></span><p><span>遭遇了攀登户外二十余载最危险的一次历险</span></p><span></span><p><span>不应让“边缘体验”无声划过，认真反思我的错与对</span></p><span></span><p><span>11级飓风吹在身上是何体验？</span></p><span></span><p><span>冰川穿越和救援的操作、思路</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么“登山是一项精神运动”？</span></p><span></span><p><span>天灾人祸中的攀登装备、技术、策略与对错</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FltoKAKThFHWm3Ouhydq3XGqWmPv.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>⛰️ 开篇与缘起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="27">00:00:27</a>: 登上“小宇宙新星榜”和“播客寻宝”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">00:01:12</a>: 本期主题——复盘一次“距离死亡最近的攀登事故”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">00:03:35</a>: 攀登“巨人齿峰”（Dent du Géant）失败经历与反思</span></p><span></span><p><span>⛰️ 风暴的误判</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="372">00:06:12</a>: “29米/秒”的含义；meteoblue好APP</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">00:09:35</a>: 错误判断路线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">00:11:10</a>: “巨人冰川”（Glacier du Géant）与“冰海冰川”（Mer de Glace）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="831">00:13:51</a>: 原本“放松下撤”，实为“生死之战”</span></p><span></span><p><span>⛰️冰川穿越和救援的技术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="866">00:14:26</a>: 冰川行走风险：冰裂缝、冰崩与隐蔽致命点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="944">00:15:44</a>: 冰川结组装备详述</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1043">00:17:23</a>: 绳距与“蝴蝶结”（Alpine Butterfly）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1297">00:21:37</a>: 探讨冰川结组的必要性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1374">00:22:54</a>: 冰川救援逻辑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1448">00:24:08</a>: 讨论结组站位——为何“新手走前、老手在后”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1530">00:25:30</a>: 自救体系详解</span></p><span></span><p><span>⛰️风雪与迷向</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1922">00:32:02</a>: 出发异常信号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2138">00:35:38</a>: 频繁跨越冰裂缝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2176">00:36:16</a>: 抵达“白色大冰原”（Vallée Blanche）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2317">00:38:37</a>: 进入“南针峰”（Aiguille du Midi）山脊，风暴前的静默时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span>⛰️暴风中的生死对抗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2404">00:40:04</a>: 真正的“每秒28米”体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2591">00:43:11</a>: 每一步都在与风抗衡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2662">00:44:22</a>: 山脊雪尽，全为坚冰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2695">00:44:55</a>: 噩梦开始</span></p><span></span><p><span>⛰️ 坠落与自救</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2950">00:49:10</a>: 攀上冰山脊，两侧万仞——“离死亡最近”的一刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2977">00:49:37</a>: 建立心理防线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3012">00:50:12</a>: 控制呼吸与节奏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3135">00:52:15</a>: 风雪弥漫，攀冰求生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3490">00:58:10</a>: 建立保护点——“生死操作”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3560">00:59:20</a>: 继续前进，生的希望乍现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3960">01:06:00</a>: 风中拥抱，“我们还活着”</span></p><span></span><p><span>⛰️复盘与反思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4350">01:12:30</a>: 教训一：凡天灾，必人祸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4380">01:13:00</a>: 教训二：“登山是一项精神运动”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4470">01:14:30</a>: 教训三：忽视客观风险</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4620">01:17:00</a>: 结语——极端条件下的判断力，比装备更重要</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmC454al64tdSAOAcrCXuia79jEY.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fjp-a0IO-KDHnPhJp1R0FrJefzpq.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsLYbBq5NGkY8Z0uI1a1pD3VvFRI.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuEXDJoSp-5Tn1PWOcYBj8rtq7As.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsNjVZIJ_uMOkDzrfsTGmM6okSlh.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqAb3qgWnIyrhtmJyRlztNHeusTJ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft14Fl2WKts89RXGq-GUPLDo6X7X.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgccOah6ODw3BdhidylbuGm3bY70.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuBw8SBRK48ZVq6ta3UxDstNao9p.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FklAV0sp3YTF2ujOwlZCT7hFqom_.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FklvPnNn3IJpIcqoUYHQhrOOdQEl.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>「法与岩」是一档攀登、户外的硬核播客，一档玩阿式攀登首席律师的干货铺，定期邀请攀登户外小伙伴，聊聊攀登技术、攀登风险管理、户外事故与纠纷、户外装备、攀登户外的趣事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主播Jeffrey，25年攀登、攀岩、越野跑、骑行、铁人三项、马拉松杂而不精的爱好者。中国探险家协会会员、中国探险家俱乐部会员；《户外探险》长期撰稿人；始祖鸟「理想化全能」全国总冠军；「亚洲商学院沙漠挑战赛」团体亚军队长。某金融集团首席合规官、仲裁员；ALB中国十五佳总法律顾问；钱伯斯大中华区最具影响力总法律顾问。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft1ZOjQYWRcf1_BGZOTKL6fVs5Nt.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67eb7e450a70cc10c1bbc32f/lszcW17qNuduBY-Sid7B6N4ncvPd.m4a" length="166253841" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:26:05</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FumhABNfWe71sa2GW4fluFwNxPt4.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
