  <item>
    <title>E07 哈萨克斯坦竟是攀岩天堂，地理学博士的奇幻旅攀丨对谈怂莉</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68f6227f456ffec65eac140e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68f6227f456ffec65eac140e</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 20 Oct 2025 22:43:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><br></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>节目简介</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span>这一期，我邀请到攀岩者“怂莉”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>她是北大地理学出身的博士，曾在美国和澳洲攻读科研，如今却在代码与岩壁之间穿梭。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在国庆假期，她背起绳索与快挂，飞向中亚——哈萨克斯坦的阿拉木图，</span></p><span></span><p><span>她在那里经历了中亚的风雪、天山的烧烤与奇幻的多段攀岩。</span></p><span></span><h2><span>如果有人跟我说，世间有这样的攀岩场地：</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>距离繁华大都市仅半小时车程</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>多达上千条的传统、运动、单段和多段线路</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>而且不仅有攀岩，还能体验海拔两三千米的阿式高山岩石线路</span></h2><span></span><h2><span>至少，偌大的中国，我还没有想到哪里有这样的岩场</span></h2><span></span><p><span>她的讲述完全颠覆了我对哈萨克斯坦的认知，</span></p><span></span><p><span>没想到，在距离大海最遥远的内陆，竟然隐藏着一个不为国人所知的野外攀岩天堂。</span></p><span></span><p><span>怂莉为我们带来了中亚攀岩的第一手体验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgjr_iMRZvJHH9ckC4nnTbkOekQf.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>收听概要</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="66">00:01:06</a>　从北大学地理到澳洲读博，聊博士攀岩群与科研式攀登的相似之处。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="260">00:04:20</a> 岩圈“卖拐”：受伤攀岩者之间流转的拐杖，成为圈内传奇。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="454">00:07:34</a>　国庆节期间，前往哈萨克斯坦阿拉木图攀岩。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="628">00:10:28</a>　阿拉木图印象：繁华都市与天山雪线近在咫尺。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="742">00:12:22</a>　意外发现：中亚首都户外氛围浓厚、满街户外店。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">00:13:55</a>　阿拉木图周边岩场：近千条线路，多为花岗岩壁。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">00:15:25</a>　两三千米高海拔岩场，融合运动攀与传统攀风格。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1079">00:17:59</a>　本地攀岩大佬，俄裔高山向导，自建网站记录全部开线。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1189">00:19:49</a>　岩质风化、手点破碎——寒冷高原的真实攀爬体验。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">00:21:40</a>　挂片密集、钉锚扎实：安全感满满的线路风格。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1359">00:22:39</a>　误入登山者纪念日现场——“Memorial”活动充满敬意与仪式感。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1458">00:24:18</a>　阿拉木图的全民户外：周末家庭登山、越野跑遍地。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1587">00:26:27</a>　交通攻略：北京—乌鲁木齐—阿拉木图航线，免签便利。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1662">00:27:42</a>　民宿奇遇：四川老板、一带一路客人与马拉松老爷爷。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1765">00:29:25</a>　露营地距离岩壁仅几百米——“城市边的山野”。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1814">00:30:14</a>　天山攀登资源丰富，从2000米到3000米皆可开线。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2008">00:33:28</a>　误爬7A难线的“意外首攀”，挑战与成就并存。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2227">00:37:07</a>　雪夜露营：木屋、帐篷与山谷避风的生存智慧。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2508">00:41:48</a> “天山烧烤”：松枝烤肠、西红柿鸡蛋面、雪夜炊烟。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2601">00:43:21</a>　重返天山：补给、露营、再战多段线路。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2664">00:44:24</a>　哈国美食探索：马肉肠与超宽面片的“大盘食光”。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2733">00:45:33</a>　手绘地图的“误导”：多段线迷失记。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3205">00:53:25</a>　意外发现：目标岩壁就在路旁五分钟！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqLOIz01s5TpF2tS5fkeVxacF7GC.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqP21_TYmJfotmhEi4KGEgFSkNEW.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkrGBHZ2YffNhyopW0ZPRGXyjnV8.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpK0O4MyoqM_0Flj7bMDcdEzshyR.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiWRCqeyVPY3ylNWz0hhmlIsQptw.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnaBlYoX5ipU-n7mDwFvw-GK04a3.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><em><span>如果你想进一步了解怂莉，欢迎关注她的小红书账号，微信视频号和微信公众号，具体如下</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>小红书账号：“怂莉的攀岩百科”</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>微信视频号：“怂莉需努力”</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>微信公众号：“莉影随行”</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrlnUZNAcEq2x4q0k1z_z259aJ9r.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67eb7e450a70cc10c1bbc32f/lnSQ7yUW5AGGnb1EWOn064Uqwpvy.m4a" length="139823230" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:12:23</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsN5npFXjEUOMHubpZ2NRsqdIiIC.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
