  <item>
    <title>E06 我从2000起攀岩事故中收获了哪些冷知识丨对谈Echo</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68e5e0538e321a0d6f44da7c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68e5e0538e321a0d6f44da7c</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 08 Oct 2025 22:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>各位好，这次我又约了一名非典型的攀岩爱好者对谈——她叫Echo（徐芃）。</span></p><span></span><p><span>她是位攀爬十年的climber、北京大妞、英国溜子、海淀佛系宝妈，同时也做了九年的保险经纪人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>她处理过超过2000件攀岩事故的保险理赔，自己也曾经攀岩受伤，她是攀岩保险的专家。</span></p><span></span><p><span>她有很多从实践中总结的，攀岩事故、理赔就医的冷知识，这些知识中有攀登小伙伴的血和泪。听一听，也许能防止我们未来受伤或者钱包疼痛。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们结合了大量的攀登事故、理赔案例，聊了：</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么近来，攀岩事故发生率增长了一倍？</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么女性攀岩者受伤，是男性的两倍？</span></p><span></span><p><span>最容易发生事故的攀岩场景是什么？以及最新趋势。</span></p><span></span><p><span>此外，</span></p><span></span><p><span>如何选购适合攀岩保险？甚至包括高海拔攀登和出境攀登。</span></p><span></span><p><span>哪些花费，保险公司不赔？哪些医院不在赔偿范围内？</span></p><span></span><p><span>攀岩受伤后，如何就医，才能最省钱？</span></p><span></span><p><span>甚至我们还聊到了就医、康复的技巧，以及事故纠纷、责任划分的基本原则。</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时如果你想进一步了解攀岩、攀登、户外保险，也欢迎你添加Echo的微信二维码，或关注她的小红书账号：“climber保险指南”。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjU0pKumDp7OrxLqXMocfVxHT5sQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>收听概要：</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="93">00:01:33</a>: 攀岩事故惊人增长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">00:06:10</a>: 女性攀岩者受伤比例高达70%！是男性的两倍？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">00:10:12</a>: 医院就医暗藏玄机，部分城市攀岩伤者竟被拒绝使用医保卡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="864">00:14:24</a>: 腰椎压缩性骨折成新秀“杀手”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="943">00:15:43</a>: 自动保护器忘记扣？真实案例曝光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1233">00:20:33</a>: 绳头虚挂酿大祸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1370">00:22:50</a>: 新手高危期警告，攀岩前6个月受伤概率爆表</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1536">00:25:36</a>: 无保险的代价：大岩壁坠落医疗费二三十万</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1637">00:27:17</a>: 小腿开放性骨折的血泪案例，攀岩前的自我评估</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1735">00:28:55</a>: 保险不赔名单公开，种牙、误工费、康复费都不赔？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1915">00:31:55</a>: 事故后黄金三步曲，理赔流程全解析</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">00:36:20</a>: 就医地点藏雷区，尼泊尔成全球保险“黑洞”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2372">00:39:32</a>: 95%事故花费低于2000元，但十万以上天价账单专找无保险的“裸奔”玩家！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2578">00:42:58</a>: 保险公司也肉疼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2646">00:44:06</a>: 买保险如扫雷tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3114">00:51:54</a>: 自甘风险≠无责！真实诉讼案例预警</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3358">00:55:58</a>: 诉讼技巧大放送</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3509">00:58:29</a>: 个人受伤血泪史：前十字韧带断裂，X光、B超、核磁怎么选？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3675">01:01:15</a>: 康复是第二场手术</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/67eb7e450a70cc10c1bbc32f/lrNAOdQ_gQeL7dZuI4beduestqms.m4a" length="98006721" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:07:34</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuNmlDatAAilgiTb3nOa-B-OZI1Y.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E05 在阿尔卑斯连续攀登40天是啥体验丨对谈循风</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68d4b5d0522b40626c2c2065</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68d4b5d0522b40626c2c2065</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 25 Sep 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一期长达两个小时的对谈，也许大部分人无法从头到尾听完</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>但是，</span><strong><span>如果你是一个阿式攀登爱好者</span></strong><span>，或者</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>你想了解阿尔卑斯的攀登世界</span></strong><span>，或者</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span>你想自主独立在阿尔卑斯地区开展攀登，而非仅仅跟着登山向导</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>那么，你不应该错过</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>这是一名5.13的阿式攀登者在阿尔卑斯地区，长达40天的连续攀登的记录</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>内容干货满满，我们畅谈</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>霞慕尼为什么是现代登山的圣城；</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>阿式攀登的难度体系；</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>如何安排40天的攀登计划与线路；</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>众多阿尔卑斯群山区域的线路风格——</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>南针峰、塔库峰、Brevent、Index、Envers、大乔拉斯、意大利侧区域等等。</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span>嘉宾“循风”，用他的亲身攀爬经历，给我们推荐了几条经典线路，</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span>风光壮丽的勃朗峰三峰线路</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>短小精悍、硬核凶险的南针峰PLAN峰穿越</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>难度极高、试炼真正阿式攀登者的大乔拉斯穿越</span></em></li><span>  </span><li><em><span>可以作为阿式攀登者第一条线路的考斯米克山脊线路</span></em></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>我们还聊到了长达40公里的皇家穿越、巨型高山花岗岩风格的线路：修士峰、巨人齿峰、Peigne峰线路等等</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>我在Show notes中附上我精心收集的线路图</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>可以一边听一边看</span></p><span></span><p><span>除此之外我们还聊了阿式攀登风格、装备选择、吃住行</span></p><span></span><p><span>以及大家最关心的如何省钱</span></p><span></span><p><span>如何最快速掌握准确、及时的攀登资源</span></p><span></span><p><span>我相信，这是一期中文播客中非常少见的、深度展现阿尔卑斯攀登的内容</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>如果你想了解关于阿尔卑斯攀登的进一步内容，可以关注我同名微信公众号中“阿尔卑斯攀登入门指南”系列专题文章</span></strong></p><span></span><p><em><span>图片：循风在攀登中</span></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqkFpk4y_TS8YHgbQK7o3cvvDfaH.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrJr_xakQAKhww7MLeuLbDr_Izz4.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>收听目录：</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="131">00:02:11</a>:循风的攀登之旅：探索阿尔卑斯山的壮丽景色！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="577">00:09:37</a>:阿尔卑斯山攀爬：四十天的极限挑战与自然风光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1151">00:19:11</a>:欧洲最高峰之争：勃朗峰的攀登挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1732">00:28:52</a>:穿越南针峰，探索勃朗峰冰原的壮丽景色！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2311">00:38:31</a>:独特的攀登横渡体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2888">00:48:08</a>:探索勃朗峰三峰线路：攀登挑战与体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3466">00:57:46</a>:穿越路线挑战：冰与岩石的复杂地形要求高超综合能力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4045">01:07:25</a>:攀爬体验与壮丽景观并存：推荐霞慕尼阿尔卑斯的三条线路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4622">01:17:02</a>:选择适合的登山路线：挑战自我极限的冒险之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5199">01:26:39</a>:体验冰爪攀岩和高山靴的穿着特点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5778">01:36:18</a>:登山过程中的挑战与成长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6356">01:45:56</a>:如何从两百年前的登山公司获得攀登信息</span></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>播客中提到的攀登线路图</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu_71EF9sSDYVfEEdPO24wBbqm8a.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpst28ZBI9jGjoAKaLkW5Dmrynw3.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhG5zI0lgtYzfx_xRy6BDGikobAR.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi0RVv4okrPnXZTSyoLz5w64ZxaZ.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhg513Nr_AeEhU_N_QRtCFd_TCcX.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu888bQnO2mOI0W0jjlAoTlmsoyc.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FraIueUYniOVnzdBpKHmnraf8zic.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmI2oOPLVFf_TazYNL7WwTLFLmVq.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsO-9drSJCkluWMbvUsxHqezxIXg.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvsDu2T3FW1sniGl7d7HrCAXx-X4.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpeOYiBUHFzuZRE-tTwNcYk6EOeF.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsrg0YUhQQCEII13lGl_4YHo5KsI.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
